        LINTAS PRESENTATION DESIGN SYSTEM
    </div>
    <div style="font-family:'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; color: #B79A61; margin-top: 2pt;">
        GitHub Repository Upload & Cross-Team Testing Protocol
    </div>
</div>

<table class="meta-table">
    <tr>
        <td class="meta-label">Author / Maintainer</td>
        <td>Lintas Group Presentation Systems Working Group</td>
